    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93279" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάπφειρ-ος</span></b>  (proparox.), ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lapis lazuli</i>,
